OL,3,GNEWSAPolice use HGV to hunt down
OL,4,Ahighway offenders
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have used an undercover HGV to
OL,7,Fhelp see into the cabins of other
OL,8,Florries as part of a road safety
OL,9,Foperation.
OL,11,FOperation Tramline, run by Cumbria
OL,12,FPolice last week, saw the lorry used in
OL,13,Fa convoy with unmarked police vehicles
OL,14,Fas part of a push to reduce collisions.
OL,16,FEight motorists were caught using their
OL,17,Fmobile phones whilst driving, with
OL,18,Fothers caught for speeding, not using a
OL,19,Fseatbelt, driving with an insecure
OL,20,Fload, and driving a vehicle with
OL,21,Fserious defects.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
