OL,3,GNEWSAPolice use HGV to hunt down
OL,4,Ahighway offenders
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wanted person was also identified and
OL,7,Farrested, a vehicle was seen reversing
OL,8,Fthe wrong way up a motorway slip road,
OL,9,Fand someone was caught driving without
OL,10,Fa licence, police said.
